-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Played by the owner in JNext 2026-11-05: approved

  Replay      IDENTICAL on 4 recordings, 37,054 frames: 42,192 plots, 1,244
              bullets, 9,380 frame hooks, every hook run; 12 of 12 negatives
              detected, a forced 3.5 MHz exit among them; ROM path check clean
              on both builds

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: loading screen, credits, menu and play
              reached from the build's own start, frames inspected; flicker
              check clean in 3 windows of 220 frames; 15-minute soak: no
              freeze, loop or crash

  Coverage    Random-key recordings only, no human play: COLOUR and MONO,
              rounds 1-7, all 3 level types, weapons 1-3, bullets, deaths,
              game over, high score, menu and restart; not reached: the boss
              path of level type 2, a real round-end bonus, define keys and
              the joystick options

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
